{
  "an4.73:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 4.73 ",
  "an4.73:0.2": "8. Apaṇṇakavagga ",
  "an4.73:0.3": "Sappurisasutta ",
  "an4.73:1.1": "“Catūhi, bhikkhave, dhammehi samannāgato asappuriso veditabbo. ",
  "an4.73:1.2": "Katamehi catūhi? ",
  "an4.73:1.3": "Idha, bhikkhave, asappuriso yo hoti parassa avaṇṇo taṁ apuṭṭhopi pātu karoti, ko pana vādo puṭṭhassa. ",
  "an4.73:1.4": "Puṭṭho kho pana pañhābhinīto ahāpetvā alambitvā paripūraṁ vitthārena parassa avaṇṇaṁ bhāsitā hoti. ",
  "an4.73:1.5": "Veditabbametaṁ, bhikkhave, asappuriso ayaṁ bhavanti. ",
  "an4.73:2.1": "Puna caparaṁ, bhikkhave, asappuriso yo hoti parassa vaṇṇo taṁ puṭṭhopi na pātu karoti, ko pana vādo apuṭṭhassa. ",
  "an4.73:2.2": "Puṭṭho kho pana pañhābhinīto hāpetvā lambitvā aparipūraṁ avitthārena parassa vaṇṇaṁ bhāsitā hoti. ",
  "an4.73:2.3": "Veditabbametaṁ, bhikkhave, asappuriso ayaṁ bhavanti. ",
  "an4.73:3.1": "Puna caparaṁ, bhikkhave, asappuriso yo hoti attano avaṇṇo taṁ puṭṭhopi na pātu karoti, ko pana vādo apuṭṭhassa. ",
  "an4.73:3.2": "Puṭṭho kho pana pañhābhinīto hāpetvā lambitvā aparipūraṁ avitthārena attano avaṇṇaṁ bhāsitā hoti. ",
  "an4.73:3.3": "Veditabbametaṁ, bhikkhave, asappuriso ayaṁ bhavanti. ",
  "an4.73:4.1": "Puna caparaṁ, bhikkhave, asappuriso yo hoti attano vaṇṇo taṁ apuṭṭhopi pātu karoti, ko pana vādo puṭṭhassa. ",
  "an4.73:4.2": "Puṭṭho kho pana pañhābhinīto